# T4.8a: two rooms, the east one's ceiling at 56 (RouteTestMaps): the
# 56-unit player fits; run east through it into the east wall, slide along
# it, turn north-east, run strafing left, walk diagonally, back off.
iwad testmap
map ceiling56
# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
50 0 0 0 x30
0 0 0 0 x8
50 30 0 0 x30
0 0 4 0 x8
50 -20 0 0 x30
25 25 0 0 x20
-50 0 0 0 x20
0 0 0 0 x10
